    <string name="help_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="help_body">Tap Speak and say things like:\n\n• “Call Rahul”\n• “Call Mom on mobile”\n• “Dial Priya Sharma at work”\n• “Papa ko call karo”\n• “Call 98765 43210”\n\nThe app says who it\'s calling and waits 2.5 seconds so you can tap Cancel.\n\nLong-press a contact to give it a voice nickname (like “Mom” or “Bhai”).\n\nLong-press the app icon and choose “Voice call” to jump straight to listening, or turn on “Start listening when app opens” in this menu.</string>
